  "parameters": "Same delta,n,e,q,om,N,cap,w,z,epsilon,X,F on both sides. Require N>1 and e>=0, epsilon<=1/500, L=N^epsilon and X>=N^(3/5). Positive fixed epsilon<1/500 supplies the separate strict exponent margin epsilon+299/500<3/5. The equality endpoint only controls the stated strict high-q test.",
